WEBVTT

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:15.950
Rachel, it's yummylicious today, too!

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:17.700
Enough already.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.620
But where are you learning
all those weird words?

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:28.370
Bigbird, no!

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:31.700
Jeez... Leo, you be careful, too.

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:34.120
He'll eat anything you drop.

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:35.700
I am ashamed.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.870
And you, Bigbird! You're a bird, aren't you?

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:40.370
If you eat people food,
you'll get a stomachache!

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:43.450
I'm back...

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.950
Yeah! Oh, Dad, you have bedhead.

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:19.910
"The Gymnastics Samurai"

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:27.160
Do each move carefully,
one by one, with no errors.

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:29.330
I think you're on the right track.

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:30.660
Yeah.

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:32.500
Next it the NHK Cup.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:33.950
Yes.

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:39.120
As you saw, the young gymnasts
have amazing momentum right now.

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:40.950
Are you talking about Minamino?

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:49.290
Not just him.

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:53.750
The new generation of young gymnasts
that are carrying the gymnastics world.

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:55.410
But don't forget.

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:57.910
What we need to do doesn't change.

00:02:57.910 --> 00:03:00.450
Polish everything you've done up until now.

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:02.580
Furthermore, for all events,

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:06.370
you must maintain precision for the moves
in your performance, or there's no point.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:09.370
You'll need to focus like you never have before.

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:10.830
Yes, sir!

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:15.410
Tackey, what's Joe talking about?

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:17.500
Prolly the NHK Cup.

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:19.410
NHK...?

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:21.660
What does that stand for?

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:28.370
Hm... N... Ninja fugitive...
Has a... Kangaroo in his pocket!

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:29.950
What are you saying?

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:33.200
The NHK Cup. It's seriously a <i>big </i>competition.

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:34.370
Big?

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:35.580
Yeah.

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:36.790
"All-Japan"                               "NHK Cup"

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:40.870
"All-Japan"                               "NHK Cup"

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:40.870
In gymnastics, there are two <i>huge </i>competitions.

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:42.290
"November"
"All-Japan"
"Top 70 or so chosen"

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:45.870
"April"
"World Championships" "Semi-finals"
"Top 35 or so chosen"

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:45.870
And then you narrow it down, you know?

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:48.750
"May"
"NHK Cup"

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:48.750
And then you've got these crazy people left!

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:51.750
"May"
"NHK Cup"

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:51.750
Like, from a group already crazy good,
you narrow it down more?

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:54.580
"May"
"NHK Cup"

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:54.580
So it's a <i>big </i>event, and it's crazy!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.790
I see, indeed.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:59.830
You scared? It's crazy, right?

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:02.330
It is war.

00:04:02.330 --> 00:04:06.910
A crazy and big Sekigahara
is waiting for Joe, right?

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:08.370
Huh...?

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:22.450
Sekigahara?

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:25.000
Your next thing isn't a duel, right?

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:29.370
I can watch your gymnastics
in a big place again!

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:33.040
Why do you want to see my gymnastics so badly?

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:33.870
Huh?

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:37.450
You said it when you started staying
with us, right? And the other day--

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:40.290
Ninja Art: Dogeza!

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:42.790
Please don't take away gymnastics from Joe!

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:48.830
Why would you go so far for my sake?

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:50.450
Did you know about me from before?

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:54.750
Uh...

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:55.870
Hm?

00:04:55.870 --> 00:04:58.450
I-It's because you're famous, indeed!

00:04:58.450 --> 00:04:59.910
At Edo Wonderland?

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:03.750
Besides, there's only one reason
I help you, indeed!

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:05.040
Hm?

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:08.370
I am the ninja of the Aragaki family!

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:09.660
"Episode 4
'Samurai Daughter.'"

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.370
"Episode 4
'Samurai Daughter.'"

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.370
♪ Indeed, indeed ♪

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:13.500
"Episode 4
'Samurai Daughter.'"

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:13.500
♪ I am a ninja, indeed ♪

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:19.410
Samurai! Yeah! Samurai! Yay!

00:05:19.410 --> 00:05:20.660
I will retire...

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:23.160
...not!

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:25.160
Wait up...!

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:26.450
I will do homework...

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:27.540
...not!

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:28.790
I will also play baseball...

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:30.450
...not!

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:33.950
Chop.

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.160
Huh?

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:50.660
What was that just now?

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:52.830
The "chop"?

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:54.660
Why did you do that?

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:58.290
Because you were making a face
like you weren't having fun, Rachel.

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:01.450
No, I wasn't.

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:02.830
Is it always--

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:04.120
No!

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:07.200
Don't tell Dad or anyone
about what you just saw!

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:08.540
No more chopping, either.

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:10.830
Don't go near anyone from my school!

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:13.750
If you don't listen to me,
then I'm done with you!

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:22.290
"Done"...?

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:24.750
Jotaro, it's about time to finish up.

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:26.790
Yes, sir...

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:28.790
How's Rei doing?

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:33.000
Yes... She's been doing a good job. Really.

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:35.450
Let's see, she's in elementary school...?

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:37.450
She just started 4th grade.

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:40.790
I see. She's really mature...

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:43.040
Good thing she took after Tomoyo.

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:47.950
Seriously. The fact that I can practice
like this is also thanks to Rei.

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:49.830
That's why I'll do my best.

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:51.830
Yeah.

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:53.000
All right!

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:08.500
Oh, this?

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:10.160
I heard about it from my daughter.

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:12.500
She said all the kids in her class
have them these days.

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:13.950
Seriously...?

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:15.910
You can also take pictures on your phone.

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:18.450
I've been taking pictures every day
and sending them to my daughter.

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:24.160
She never replies, though!

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:31.290
Ayu, I'm going home now.

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:33.950
Thanks for helping me with
my homework today, too!

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:37.660
No prob. You're like, super smart, anyway.

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:40.500
See you tomorrow!

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:41.700
'Kay!

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:48.830
Huh? What happened?

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:55.200
Rachel said she's done with me.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.120
Lady Ayu, what does that mean?

00:07:57.120 --> 00:08:00.450
Hm... You can't see her ever again?

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:02.790
Huh?! Whyever not?!

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:06.040
Well? What happened?

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:08.000
That is what happened, indeed.

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:11.080
That's like seriously the Battle of Chibi...

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:12.080
--Huh?
--Like, before you knew it,
there was a sea of fire.

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:15.250
--Like, before you knew it,
there was a sea of fire.

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:17.540
Red... Cliffs...?

00:08:17.540 --> 00:08:18.790
That's it!

00:08:18.790 --> 00:08:22.750
There are times when you can't tell
which way the wind is blowing, you know?

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:25.450
Makes you super nervous, you know?

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:31.750
I'm off!

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:33.620
Dad, hope you have a good day, too!

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:35.750
Have a nice day!

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:53.500
That boy's not coming today?

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:57.410
He said something about "red" and "cliffs"...

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:02.500
Okay, hurry up now!

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:04.080
The bell's about to ring!

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:08.330
See? Ding-dong, ding-don--hm?!

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:12.580
W-Wait...

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:14.450
Wait a minute, you!

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:16.790
I am here on an investigation, indeed.

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:18.910
Wait, who are you investigating?

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:20.830
There aren't any thieves here.

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:23.120
You're the one who needs to be investigated!

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:25.250
First, take off that head covering!

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:26.290
Insolent man!

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:27.580
That'd be <i>you</i>!

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:41.500
Oh, yeah, in the game yesterday,
I got a hat trick.

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:43.250
Man, you're like Ronaldo!

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:44.700
Wow, you're Henry!

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:47.410
Don't you wanna see my Bergkamp trap?

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:29.620
Okay, pass around the handouts.

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:33.370
Round and round, I'm going round and round, too.

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:35.370
"Parents' Day Notice"

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:41.830
Hey, Aragaki. Is the Samurai
coming to Parents' Day?

00:10:41.830 --> 00:10:43.540
He probably won't come, as usual.

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:44.750
Which means...

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:47.870
The Samurai will come to Parents' Day...

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:49.950
...<i>not</i>!

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:51.660
Stop it, boys!

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:54.580
The Samurai at Rei's place is busy!

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:58.790
If he loses again, he might actually retire!

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:21.540
"Aragaki Family Grave"

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:28.750
Leo, you're here, right?

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:32.160
To see through me...

00:11:32.160 --> 00:11:34.790
As expected, indeed.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:39.120
This is my mom's grave.

00:11:39.120 --> 00:11:40.450
Your mother's...?

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:45.870
Mom, this is Leo. He's a ninja who
followed us home from Edo Wonderland,

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:48.040
and he lives with us right now.

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:54.120
I am Leo, indeed.

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:57.200
Your mother was a famous actress, right?

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:58.040
Yeah!

00:11:58.040 --> 00:12:01.540
But that's not all! She was
perfect in her normal life, too!

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:03.620
She could do anything, and do it fast!

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:09.330
Her food was delicious,
and she cheered on Dad a lot...

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:12.000
She was always smiling...

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:15.540
She sounds a lot like you, indeed.

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:22.200
What's the matter?

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:24.870
Not at all...

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:29.160
I need to do my best, like she did.

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:30.700
Rachel...

00:12:34.080 --> 00:12:39.080
Ever since I met you,
every day has been fun, indeed.

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:42.450
I'm very thankful and happy
that you allow me to stay in your home

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:45.660
and spend time with me.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:50.080
It is time for me to repay the favor.

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:52.040
What's with you all of a sudden?

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:54.290
Let's go to Grandma's place already!

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:07.950
I told you, customers should sit down.

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:09.910
Anyway, don't you have to practice?

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:13.250
I finished real fast. It was easy!

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:16.080
Anyway, anyone would do this, you know?

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:17.830
I'm back, indeed.

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:19.660
Hey, Leo-chi.

00:13:20.790 --> 00:13:22.700
Oh? Where's Rachel?

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:23.910
She just went home.

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:25.660
She said she was done with her homework.

00:13:25.660 --> 00:13:28.750
I see...

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:31.870
Oh, man, Leocchi!

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:34.950
Man, Parents' Day and stuff takes me back.

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:38.700
Wait. When was the last time I had it...?

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:40.540
I can't remember. Oh, man.

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:42.830
--Do I have amnesia?
--Parents' Day?

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:44.370
What's that?

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:48.750
You know, when Mom gets super dressed up!

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:51.080
And so you say, "That'll just
make you stand out more!"

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:53.700
And then she hits you...

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:57.870
Hey, Mari.

00:13:57.870 --> 00:13:59.200
Hey!

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:06.500
Where did you get this?

00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:09.120
I found it in the trash.

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:10.540
I see.

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:14.540
Rachel must've dropped it.

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:16.700
I'll bring it to her!

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:19.370
Leo, come here for a second.

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:20.500
Hm?

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:25.040
Oh, shoot! We don't have stuff
for the fried udon set.

00:14:25.040 --> 00:14:26.700
--We're gonna go buy some!

00:14:26.700 --> 00:14:28.790
--Huh? What? Set? What set?
--We're gonna go buy some!

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:30.160
Like ready-made?

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:32.200
Wait, are we a set right now, Ayu-chi?

00:14:34.370 --> 00:14:35.790
What's the matter?

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:38.000
Parents' Day, huh?

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:41.290
I've also gone before. Many times...

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:51.040
The Samurai's not here! It's your grandma!

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:53.160
Your grandma's not like a samurai at all.

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:57.250
Then, what about the Samurai?
He's not coming today?

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:58.910
He's not!

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:08.000
Rei...

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:12.120
Grandma, everyone was really noisy
talking about "the Samurai," huh?

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:14.200
They don't do that normally.

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:18.000
Oh, sorry to make you come
even though you have work.

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:20.750
She's a kind child.

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:23.000
But she lets her imagination run wild
and gets the wrong idea.

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:27.160
If something happens,
she ends up thinking it's her fault...

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:30.580
With her father the way he is,

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:34.040
and me standing out even if I don't want to...

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:35.790
Since she threw it away,

00:15:35.790 --> 00:15:40.250
it means that it'd only cause
problems for her if I went.

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:43.040
I saw, indeed...

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:45.290
Then, I must act!

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:50.370
Lady Mari, I have a favor to ask, indeed!

00:15:53.540 --> 00:15:56.330
Later, Dad. Make sure you lock up, okay?

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:57.660
I'm off!

00:15:57.660 --> 00:15:59.330
Right. Have a nice day!

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:06.750
If you don't listen to me,
then I'm done with you!

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:15.370
Leo, it's almost time to go.

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:17.950
I cannot go today.

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:21.040
Oh? You have something to do?

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:22.700
Joe, do your best at practice.

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:26.410
Fight with everything you have
at your Sekigahara, indeed.

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:28.160
R-Right...

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:34.620
Next, next!

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:36.330
Yay, my mom's here!

00:16:36.330 --> 00:16:38.120
Your family's really fired up!

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:40.410
Oh, Kazu's mom's here, too!

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:42.200
Who's not here yet?

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:45.450
Hey, someone kind of amazing came...

00:16:45.450 --> 00:16:46.870
A foreigner?

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:49.200
Someone's older brother, maybe?

00:16:51.830 --> 00:16:54.410
--No way!
--Wow, he's so handsome!
--Is that someone's big brother?

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:56.580
--So cool!
--Did we have a foreigner in our class?
--Who's family is he?

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:57.830
Huh?!

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:07.290
Rachel!

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:11.580
--"Rachel"?
--Aragaki?!

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:21.620
If you know the answer, raise your hand.

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:31.160
That guy's super cheering you on. It's crazy!

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:33.620
Rachel! Rachel!

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:37.410
"Rachel"? Oh, is he talking about you, Aragaki?

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:39.580
Okay then, Aragaki?

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:42.450
317 remainder 1.

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:43.410
Correct!

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:45.910
Woo! Rachel!

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:48.660
Splendid! A round of applause!

00:17:48.660 --> 00:17:51.830
--Rachel! Splendid!
--Rachel's amazing!

00:17:54.660 --> 00:17:57.410
Okay, okay. Be quiet, everyone!

00:17:57.410 --> 00:17:59.500
We're moving on to the next question!

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:04.790
Yes, Rachel!

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:07.250
She knows the next one, too! Try asking her!

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:09.750
Rachel, don't be shy! Come now!

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:11.870
Rachel, come now!

00:18:11.870 --> 00:18:20.620
Rachel! Rachel! Rachel!

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:26.290
Leo, over here!

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:27.330
Rachel!

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:30.330
We've become friends, indeed!

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:32.540
Hey, why do you call her "Rachel"?

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:34.660
Leo, what's your relationship with Aragaki?

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:36.160
Are you her brother?

00:18:36.160 --> 00:18:39.040
I am a ninja who protects Rachel.

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:40.250
--Ninja?
--So cool!

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:43.120
--Seriously?
--That's amazing!

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:45.000
Rachel! Rachel!

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:47.750
Rachel, everyone's nice, indeed!

00:18:47.750 --> 00:18:49.120
You should be friends--

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:56.580
You stupid ninja!

00:18:56.580 --> 00:18:57.790
Huh?

00:18:57.790 --> 00:18:58.910
What are you doing?!

00:18:58.910 --> 00:19:01.580
Why are you clapping your hands
all friendly with them?!

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:03.000
And that "Rachel! Rachel!"

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:05.620
It sounded like a Hollywood star,
so I thought it was fine,

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:09.450
but to be called that over and over by so
many people! Who'd be happy about that?!

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:11.250
Anyway, why are you at
my school in the first place?

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:14.080
I didn't say anything about Parents' Day, did I?

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:16.200
I don't get it! Why are you here?!

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:18.000
And what's with those clothes?!

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:20.000
You're not even a ninja anymore!

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:22.160
You guys, too!

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:25.040
You're always gathered together!
What's so fun about that?!

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:26.830
Making fun of my dad, saying "Samurai! Samurai!"

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:29.080
You've never even talked to him before!

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:31.700
You don't know that he practices
every day until nighttime!

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:33.540
There's nothing embarrassing about him at all!

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:34.790
I'm proud of him!

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:38.080
My dad really is the world's best samurai!

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:42.410
Compared to him, you guys
are just common foot soldiers!

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:50.950
Ninja Art...

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:54.700
Dogeza.

00:19:57.910 --> 00:20:00.080
Come, you all do it, too.

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:05.790
I'm sorry...

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:28.370
Why did you do that?

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:31.200
Because you weren't smiling.

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:32.910
Hm?

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:37.830
You didn't look like you
were having fun at school.

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:41.540
I wanted you to smile.

00:20:42.580 --> 00:20:46.200
I want to help you anytime, anywhere.

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:53.700
Aw, man! Thanks to you,
everyone's gonna think I get mad easily.

00:20:53.700 --> 00:20:55.910
I said everything I was thinking out loud, too.

00:20:55.910 --> 00:20:57.500
This sucks.

00:20:57.500 --> 00:21:00.750
Rachel, can you ever forgive me?

00:21:00.750 --> 00:21:04.580
Aw, man. How should I look
when I go to school tomorrow?

00:21:04.580 --> 00:21:07.370
What should I do?

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:09.950
I'm sorry, indeed!

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:11.910
Do you really think that?

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:16.500
Oh, by the way, you're the only one
allowed to call me "Rachel."

00:21:17.660 --> 00:21:19.410
Rachel!

00:21:20.450 --> 00:21:22.160
Oh, we need more milk.

00:21:22.160 --> 00:21:24.750
I'll be off in a jiffy!

00:21:43.750 --> 00:21:44.950
Morning.
